== The wave equation on a product manifold and enrgy conservation

#paragraph_tab
The analysis of vibrating membranes in Euclidean spcae has important extensions to studies of vibrating manifolds. We will start with a fairly general situation, specializing quickly to models that gives rise to "the wave equation".
$
  frac(partial^2 u, partial t^2) = Delta u
